  "title": "Eddington: neutral stuff is the wrong amendment to mind-stuff",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "7dc5d22d-73e0-44cc-be3b-edc06766cf83",
      "text": "Eddington allowed that the term mind-stuff might be amended, but held that calling it neutral stuff is the wrong amendment, since it implies two avenues of approach to its nature when there is only one, direct knowledge of mind.",
